{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:75c7dffc88bb0428","name":"Baffled Drive","source":{"id":"source:reference-75c7dffc88bb0428","title":"Baffled Drive","revision":16115,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:18Z","sha256":"e4290aade00bc47c4c6277cde3f3cef084959d361257465488eb68d256d95c4b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16115","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Baffled%20Drive&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-75c7dffc88bb0428","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size Restriction:"]}," Colossal or Larger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 100,000 (Base)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Baffled Drives are favored by smugglers moving through dangerous, highly patrolled star systems and anyone else that needs to move through space with a modicum of stealth. A Baffled Drive uses supercooled Tibanna gas that leaves no visible trail, making it incredibly difficult to detect the ship with sensors.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Baffled Drive always gives a Starship a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"}," speed of 2 squares, and has a limited fuel capacity. A Starship's Baffled Drive can move the ship up to 100 squares (total) before it needs to be refueled; refueling a Baffled Drive has a base cost of 1,400 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"}," credits. A ship moving with a Baffled Drive adds +5 to the DC of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check made to detect the ship, and if the ship has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Baffling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Baffling","referenceId":"reference:2c7d1e055d3ab0f7"}," it can move up to twice its base ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," in one turn without losing the benefit of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Baffling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Baffling","referenceId":"reference:2c7d1e055d3ab0f7"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
